      "text": "LOOK: Cσʂρʅαყ Mαɳια 2025 MG Hall Update!\nHappening Now: Interested in joining stamp rallies but not sure how to start and where? Here are some of the stamp rallies available in our fanfair booths! If unsure there's a stamp rally, roam your eyes in the booth or ask the individual behind or beside the booth ✨ From Plave to One Piece to Pokémon stamp rallies, there might also be one for you! You can join in multiple stamp rallies 👀\n\nComing UP Meet & Greets:\n1:00PM to 2:30PM Meet and Greet with Thames at Hall MG M&G Room 1\n1:00PM to 2:00PM Meet and Greet with Hiroto Kuramasu at Hall MG M&G Room 3\n3:30PM to 4:30PM Meet and Greet with Kairi Miura at Hall MG M&G Room 2\n3:30PM to 5:00PM  Meet and Greet with Kousuke Asuma at Hall MG M&G Room 3\n4:00PM to 6:00PM Meet and Greet with Hiroto Kuramasu at Hall EX Cybird Booth\n4:00PM to 6:00PM Meet and Greet with Thames and Le Josette at Hall MG M&G Room 1 and 2\n\nCelebrate cosplay awesomeness at 🍁 Cσʂρʅαყ Mαɳια 2025 🍁: 𝒜𝓌𝑒𝓈𝑜𝓂𝑒 𝒜𝓊𝓉𝓊𝓂𝓃 on October 3-5, 2025 at Halls 1-4 at the SMX Convention Center Manila, Pasay City. Enjoy the Seasons of Cosplay unfold as we celebrate 25 years of cosplay together! #cosplay #cosplayph #CosplayMania2025",
